    "rich_text_rtmC37": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_cftcyh": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<h2 style= \"text-align: default; color:#181818;\">The Regeneration Effect:<span style= \"color: #FF8F00;\"><BR> Before & After </span></h2>"
          }
        },
        "richtext_LjQUTz": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Your water doesn’t just hydrate you—it’s how nutrients, supplements, and minerals actually reach your cells.<br/><br/><strong>BEFORE</strong> <br/>Regular tap or filtered water is fine for thirst. But it’s often too acidic, lacks key minerals, and its molecules are too clustered for your cells to absorb efficiently. You drink plenty—but your cells stay thirsty. <br/><br/><strong>AFTER (CELLNERGY-CONDITIONED WATER) </strong><br/>CELLNERGY-conditioned water is alkaline, hydrogen-rich, and restructured for absorption. Your cells get more of what they need. Your supplements work harder. You actually feel the difference.* </p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS</strong><br/>Better water in = better results out. When your cells are properly hydrated, everything improves: more energy, clearer thinking, faster recovery, healthier skin. It’s not adding something new to your routine — it’s making everything you already do work better.* </p>"
          }
        },
        "divider_cCQyhJ": {
          "type": "divider",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "image_czzXq7": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Water_Bottle_befroe_after.png",
            "width_mode": "custom",
            "max_width": 600,
            "mobile_max_width": 400
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "liquid_cftcyh",
        "richtext_LjQUTz",
