    "design_pack_image_with_text_dmbjfe": {
      "type": "design_pack_-_image_with_text",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_zfbQFL": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<h2 style= \"text-align: default; color:#181818;     font-size: var(--text-h2);\n    line-height: 1.1; font-family: var(--heading-font-family);\n}\">The Regeneration Effect:<span style= \"color: #FF8F00;\"><BR> Before & After </span></h2>"
          }
        },
        "spacer_99mchn": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "size": 40
          }
        },
        "fancy_heading_dfVPFj": {
          "type": "fancy_heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Regeneration Effect: [Before & After]",
            "block_heading_color": "",
            "block_heading_size": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "#ff8f00",
            "highlight_background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "highlight_heading_size": "",
            "highlight_enable_custom_font": true,
            "highlight_custom_font": "playfair_display_n4",
            "heading_level": "h2",
            "custom_css": ""
          }
        },
        "text_XfxkQ7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Your water doesn’t just hydrate you — it’s how nutrients, supplements, and minerals actually reach your cells. The quality of your water determines how much of what you do for your health actually lands.<br/><br/><strong>BEFORE (REGULAR WATER)</strong></p><ul><li>Neutral to slightly acidic (pH 6.5–7.5) — not optimized for the body’s natural alkaline state</li><li>Large, disorganized water clusters — limited cellular permeability</li><li>No active hydrogen — no antioxidant support from your water</li><li>Supplements and nutrients absorbed without an optimized delivery environment</li><li>You drink plenty. Your cells may still be thirsty.</li></ul><p><em>Standard water does the basics. But it’s not built for regeneration.</em></p><p><strong>AFTER (CELLNERGY-CONDITIONED WATER) </strong></p><ul><li>Alkaline pH 8–9.5 — naturally conditioned to support cellular balance and mineral harmony</li><li>Terahertz-restructured water clusters — smaller, more organized, designed for cellular absorption</li><li>Active molecular hydrogen — one of nature’s most studied antioxidants, delivered in every sip</li><li>An optimized hydration environment for supplements, LifePharm products, and nutrients to work harder</li><li>Smoother. Cleaner. Water that supports how your body was designed to function.∗</li></ul><p><em>Better water in. Better results out. Everything you do for your health, working at full capacity.</em></p>",
            "block_text_color": "#181818"
          }
        },
        "liquid_cYJzGR": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<p>Your water doesn&rsquo;t just hydrate you &mdash; it&rsquo;s how nutrients, supplements, and minerals actually reach your cells. The quality of your water determines how much of what you do for your health actually lands.<br /><br /><strong>BEFORE (REGULAR WATER)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Neutral to slightly acidic (pH 6.5&ndash;7.5) &mdash; not optimized for the body&rsquo;s natural alkaline state</li>\n<li>Large, disorganized water clusters &mdash; limited cellular permeability</li>\n<li>No active hydrogen &mdash; no antioxidant support from your water</li>\n<li>Supplements and nutrients absorbed without an optimized delivery environment</li>\n<li>You drink plenty. Your cells may still be thirsty.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Standard water does the basics. But it&rsquo;s not built for regeneration.</em></p>\n<p><strong>AFTER (CELLNERGY-CONDITIONED WATER) </strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alkaline pH 8&ndash;9.5 &mdash; naturally conditioned to support cellular balance and mineral harmony</li>\n<li>Terahertz-restructured water clusters &mdash; smaller, more organized, designed for cellular absorption</li>\n<li>Active molecular hydrogen &mdash; one of nature&rsquo;s most studied antioxidants, delivered in every sip</li>\n<li>An optimized hydration environment for supplements, LifePharm products, and nutrients to work harder</li>\n<li>Smoother. Cleaner. Water that supports how your body was designed to function.&lowast;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Better water in. Better results out. Everything you do for your health, working at full capacity.</em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
